dashboard_cards.description:
e-C3 Dashboard requires Bubble Card, Button Card, ha-map-card and layout-card. This is a best-effort check of Home Assistant's registered Lovelace resources:

{card_status}

A registered resource is not proof that the browser loaded it. Install missing cards with HACS, make sure each is registered as a JavaScript module, then restart Home Assistant and refresh the browser. The dashboard performs the final browser-side check before rendering.
